<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8963"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Researcher<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Researcher<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 25, 2005 - 5:04 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Well Skov and the likes have proved what an over active imagination and a comuter connected tothe Internet cand do. And that is?  To be WRONG!!! <BR> <BR>Sorry Skov.  Goodnight.  Turn out the lights. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
