</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 28, 2005 - 6:49 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Skov is a researcher extraordinnaire - and a cool person all the way around.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9800-->
<!--Post: 9855--><!--Time: 1109661675-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9855"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:bmodule_244@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Bmodule<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 28, 2005 - 11:21 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I am assuming that this is all about Skov&#39;s post about the P.I. named Goad. If so, I don&#39;t see why anyone is finds it funny. I followed the link and down in the archives was the title about the P.I. and the woman, and like Skov predicted the link dead ends. <BR> <BR>The basic content of the story, regarding the church aspect anyway, is so close to Rader&#39;s involvement in the Lutheran church &#40;child molesting aspect unknown&#41; that I have been thinking that Skov&#39;s post &#40;Thursday, shortly after noon&#41;is the reason that the WPD moved in on Rader Friday am.  <BR> <BR>Talk at the time was that it was VERY unusual to run an operation of that magnitude at the end of the week because the people involved in the processing are M-F folks.  <BR> <BR>I think Skov dug up something from way back that the PD thought had been forgotten, and had enough truth to it &#40;NOT saying Landweir knew Rader&#41;that the police were afraid the case would be solved on the internet. Hence the &#34;News Conference&#34; Saturday am, which was basically a declaration of full credit &#40;not totally undeserved, but tacky&#41;. <BR> <BR>Good hunt Skov. I think that there was a misunderstanding by some who thought you had found the story on Rader and were posting it. <BR> <BR>If I&#39;m missing something, feel free to set me straight, but this has been bothering me.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9855-->
<!--Post: 9862--><!--Time: 1109664531-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9862"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 12:08 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Oh my GOd, we started this In Talking to Tom, because Skov was missing the excitement, we all thought he was asleep, how did we go from waking him up to going to bed, lol  I for one want to say great job skov and thanks for the help.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9862-->
<!--Post: 9872--><!--Time: 1109671016-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9872"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nightdriver<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nightdriver<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 1:56 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I was wondering how many people would recognize Skov&#39;s web surfing ability for what it is, vastly superior to most of us. I am still at a loss to understand the methodology used in unearthing some of those tidbits. Perhaps some of us interested in discussing amateur crime research on the web could find or start a new group, perhaps on Yahoo, devoted to this subject. Skov, if you don&#39;t make a living in the IT field, you&#39;re missing the boat. Thank you for all you have shown us. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
