<!--Post: 10204--><!--Time: 1109813532-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10204"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 5:32 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hej Skov! Trevligt att träffas. Varifrån kommed du i sverige? <BR> Jag kommer från amerika men är 100% svenska. Min släktforskning finns från notbotten, västerbotten, medelpad, värmland, västergotland och småland. <BR> <BR>I would not think it likely that any of Dennis Rader&#39;s relatives would have known or had anything to do with the crimes he his accused of. <BR>His youngest brother in an interview indicated he wasn&#39;t real close to him but couldn&#39;t imagine him as a killer. <BR>The father was a strict disaplinarian and a strictly religious man so Dennis got that pubic side of his persona from his father. His private side was dark and I think very private. That&#39;s why he remained on the loose for so long. No one was in on his scret life. <BR>Of course in this case nothing would suprise me anymore.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10204-->
<!--Post: 10252--><!--Time: 1109852635-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10252"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 4:23 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hej johno <BR>Jag kommer från Stockholm, född där och växste upp där till jag var 10 år, blev sedan flyttad till Danmark när min mamma dog. Så jag har nu bott i Danmark i 39 år. <BR>Min pappa var norsk, men faktiskt amerikans medborgare, han gik på ALFRED UNIVERSITY,NY. <BR>Kommer du någonsinn hem till Severige? Min bror bor fortfarande i Stockholm. <BR> <BR>Regarding the Rader brother question, IF they were involved they would do anything to hide it of course so what the brother say to indicate he was not close to his btother Dennis, or that he couldn´t imaging Dennis a murderer doesentmean a thing IMO. <BR> Regarding his father beeing a religious man? well so is Dennis Rader, so that doesent mean a thing either IMO <BR> <BR>Think about it THREE people confessed the crime not ONE nutcase, three people is a LOT. and connect that with that the two dude brothers matching Dennises brothers exactly at the time. <BR>I´m not saying that I´m sure this is the truth AT ALL but I will keep it in myb little collection of still going theories. <BR>Remember there is a LOT we dont know about DR yet, his inner world we know nothing more than we did before he was caught. And we know NOTHING about his childhood realy, I mean what was his mother and father like??? I´d like to know, I dont by the perfect picture Jeff Rader is selling AT ALL... <BR> <BR>hugs...skov<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10252-->
<!--Post: 10310--><!--Time: 1109892190-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10310"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 3:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Skov, no I&#39;ve never been there. Many in my family have. My mormors first kusin was svenska stasminister Tage Erlander. His father and my great-grandfather were brothers. He would visit us too when he would come to the USA. Another more distant kusin of mine was svenska skådespelerska Viveca Lindfors. I have several distant kusins I email with there so I hope to go someday soon. <BR> <BR>I would think that if any of Dennis Rader&#39;s brothers had ever been questioned in the BTK case we would have heard about that by now. I don&#39;t think they ever disclosed the names of the &#39;three dudes&#39; that had confessed to being BTK back in the 70&#39;s.  <BR>You would have to wonder however if at anytime BTK had an accomplice or more than one over the years who he may have also killed when they were of no use to him anymore. If so it could have been a young man who was either a member of BTK&#39;s church or someone he knew from when he was a scoutmaster. If I was in Wichita law enforcement I would be looking into any deaths of members of Dennis Rader&#39;s church or scout troop that died under suspicious circustances.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10310-->
<!--Post: 10411--><!--Time: 1109922792-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10411"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 11:53 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ok you people in here are toooooo smart for me lol, but I am thinking, because I do that from time to time, if not a brother, than which one of his friends came back from Air Force killing nightmare with him, that he stayed in contact with. Cause you can bet something messed his head up more over there. I can&#39;t speak German, so I have to write in Spanish no nevermind, English for now lol<!--/Text--></td></tr>
